    <h1>Why 90% of Startups Fail in India — And How to Avoid It</h1>

    <p>India has become one of the most vibrant startup hubs in the world. But the reality is harsh: over 90% of startups in India fail within the first 5 years. Why does this happen, and what can founders do differently?</p>

