    <h2>4. Legal & Compliance Blind Spots</h2>
    <p>Many founders don’t realize how damaging GST errors, labor law violations, or incorrect business structures can be. Legal strategy is as important as product strategy.</p>

    <h2>5. No Real Marketing Strategy</h2>
    <p>Startups often rely on word of mouth or boosted Instagram posts. That’s not sustainable. You need funnels, retargeting, content, and lead magnets.</p>

